			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 3890601,
					"content": "沒辦法更進一步了呢，在這座遺蹟裡好像有一些非常古老的<color=#00E1FFFF>封印</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890602,
					"content": "這也是特瓦林搞的鬼嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890603,
					"content": "不是的。這座廢墟曾經是遠古的城市，特瓦林只是在這裡臨時居住而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890604,
					"content": "廢墟本身，其實比「四風守護」的時代更古老。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890605,
					"content": "蒙德是無人稱王的城邦，而在蒙德建立之前…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890606,
					"content": "曾有一位暴君統治這裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890607,
					"content": "嗯…以後如果有機會，再為你們演奏那位君王的故事吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890608,
					"content": "這封印的樣式…按我所知道的考古學知識，應該是<color=#00E1FFFF>「導光機關」</color>吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890609,
					"content": "把散落的所有<color=#00E1FFFF>部件</color>放回<color=#00E1FFFF>本體</color>，就能完成<color=#00E1FFFF>導光的儀式</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890610,
					"content": "從現場的狀況看，這座機關的導光儀式似乎離完成不遠了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3890611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 3890611,
					"content": "先把<color=#00E1FFFF>最後的部件</color>放回去，再看看情況吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				}
			]
		}
	]
